  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  interactionText: I need to get off at the next stop.
  hasChoices: 1
  yesText: "But what if someone already pressed it? Maybe we\u2019re still too far...
    will the driver think I wanted to get off earlier? People will look at me\u2026
    they all hate me- [someone else pressed the button]"
  noText: "But I have to- I need to go to school! What if the bus won\u2019t stop?
    Will I get in trouble? Momma will be mad\u2026 and my grades are already bad-
    [someone else pressed the button]"
  sequenceTexts: []
